{"id":797864,"title":"结束语｜展望未来，AI赋能下的无限可能","content":"本课程为AI PPT创作实战课的总结，回顾了课程内容并展望未来。课程分为四章：第一章介绍PPT设计基础，包括设计原则和工具推荐；第二章讲解AI在PPT制作中的基础应用，如一键生成模板、内容创建优化等；第三章深入探讨高级AI PPT设计技巧，涵盖插件优化、创意动画等；第四章通过实战案例总结课程。第二章和第三章为核心章节，重点介绍了7种基础应用和6种高级技巧。课程共涉及88个AI工具，覆盖多个领域，并提供了129个案例供学习。特别推荐了12个常用且高效的AI工具，如文心一言、讯飞智文等。展望未来，AI技术将更加成熟，PPT设计更智能化，国产AI工具有望爆发式增长，逐步缩小与国际先进水平的差距，AI将在工作生活中广泛应用，带来无限可能。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":394273,"user_name":"Geek_830532","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2872945,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"9F2D3CA1F2FA43","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2b/d6/71/909770b0.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1726296828,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":143123,"content":"这门课程没有课件啊～","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1501385,"ctime":1726298169,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":394273,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100769901,"comment_content":"可以找老师拿一下课件PPT吗","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1501385,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","nickname":"听水的湖","note":"","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":651151,"discussion_content":"这门课程没有课件啊～","content_length":10,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1726298169,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}